      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030216,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喂，拉莫。绯花里演的……那个青年是什么人？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302160050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030216008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030216,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "剧本没有明说，不过他是受某位富豪雇佣的家庭教师。/n他和学生一起搭乘了横渡太平洋的客船，然而……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302160060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030216009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030216,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我懂了。后面不用说了。是个悲伤的故事。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302160070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030216010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030216,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可青年并不悲伤，而是努力表现得很开朗。/n即使内心悲痛，也必须保持笑容。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302160080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
